<h1>Adventures in Microsoft Agent Framework</h1>
<p>Build streaming agents with tools and session history, compose multi-agent workflows, and explore retrieval, clustering, and tokenization.</p>
<p>Start with <a href="configuration">OpenAI or OpenRouter configuration</a> and then try the <a href="samples">runnable examples</a>.</p>
<p>Legacy Stepwise/Handlebars planners and marketplace manifest imports are retired. Use <a href="simpleAgent">tool-calling agents</a> and bundled typed API tools instead.</p>
<p>Generated code runs on this host only after explicit approval or your Run click. This demo is not a code sandbox and must not be exposed to untrusted users. Existing SQLite databases are untouched; new indexes start empty.</p>
